ComfyUI-BAT-CorridorKey2
========================

This repository contains only ComfyUI integration code. Everything below is
downloaded on first use from its original publisher and is NOT redistributed
here. Each component stays under its own licence.


1. CorridorKey 2.0 (runtime code and model weights)
   https://github.com/nikopueringer/CorridorKey2.0
   https://huggingface.co/nikopueringer/CorridorKey2.0
   Licence: Corridor Key Licence v2.0 (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 with Additional Terms)
   Copyright (c) Corridor Digital LLC
   Pinned commit: see ck2/UPSTREAM_MANIFEST.json

   This pack's ck2/driver.py follows the structure of upstream's
   corridorkey/runtime.py (run_inference, precompute_rvm_to_memmap,
   precompute_foundations_to_memmap, hann_stage1_stream) so that it gives the
   same result from in-memory tensors; it calls upstream's own functions for the
   model, colour transforms, padding, windowing and despill.

